From 7252756e936740771bac43fa74b66b050b8c68ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaptainCucumber <37813159+CaptainCucumber@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:07:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add capped retained native rail vehicle purchase

Capture the normal build command's returned vehicle ID, disable implicit adoption, and persist typed engine identity with schema-4 migration.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
